00:26:22.000 --> 00:27:09.000
making the demand down the hill remained undisclosed. The community were urged to report anyone they knew who had abruptly missed work or canceled plans on February 13, or had changed their appearance, behavior, travel plans, sleep patterns, or substance use in the days following the murders. In addition to studying the suspect's clothing, investigators encouraged the public to consider his posture and mannerisms, such as the way his hand was placed in his pants pocket, as these minor habits may appear familiar to those who knew him. Police reiterated that no detail was too small and implored citizens to name all possible persons

