00:27:09.000 --> 00:27:59.000
of interest, even if they believed that individual was incapable of committing such crimes. A $41,000 reward was launched for information leading to an arrest, with FBI Special Agent Greg Messer firmly stating he was confident that the case will be solved. Indiana State Police Superintendent Douglas Carter said, We must keep our resolve for Libby and Abbey, for this community, and frankly, to ensure that good trumps evil. He ended the conference with a message to the perpetrator, warning, if you are watching, we'll find you.

