00:40:36.000 --> 00:41:36.000
evil. When Liberty's grandparents, Mike and Becky Patty, met some Indiana residents who had never heard of the case or seen the suspect's image before, they decided to front their own awareness campaign. They set to work distributing wanted posters depicting the suspect, and soon thousands were on display all over the country. Becky Patty told Indiana newspaper Journal and Courier, We are asking everyone all over the United States to help us. We want to cover the entire U.S. with this picture so he can not go into a town where there is not a flyer staring him in the face. Her husband, Mike, added, Police are not giving up and neither are we. I will spend every day of my life trying to catch this guy. I still believe someone out there knows something.

