cry for you, although we know you would not want us to. Our hearts will heal, our thoughts will clear, but in our hearts will keep you near. For God has welcomed you with open arms, with his love, and without any more harm. We'll keep your memories in our minds, but happiness without you is awful hard to find. You will always be a blessing no one can replace our love for you, but living without you is the hardest thing we do. We'll wipe our tears for you in a better place, and keep our memories of you that no one can erase. you There aren't comments yet for this episode. Click on any sentence in the transcript to leave a comment.
